From: Xios Project <xios@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Build the Darwin process checks for the GTK port

The WebKitGTK release tarball omits Apple-port build fragments, but a real
Darwin target still enables the Cocoa/iOS bmalloc declarations. Add the shared
implementation directly on Darwin so GTK cross-builds do not leave those
symbols undefined.

--- a/Source/bmalloc/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/Source/bmalloc/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -664,6 +664,7 @@ set(bmalloc_PUBLIC_HEADERS
 if (CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME MATCHES "Darwin")
     list(APPEND bmalloc_SOURCES
+        bmalloc/ProcessCheck.mm
         bmalloc/Zone.cpp
     )
 endif ()
